## The game in Rewards

Rewards has **Today''s game**: press **Play now** and one of the discount games (the wheel, a scratch card, blackjack and the others) shows your prize. Every game wins CarmaCars Rewards points, never a discount code: 10 to 250 points, drawn by the site, not by the game. One game a day (Admins set how many). Your points go to your CarmaCars Rewards account as a renter; if you have never rented with us they are saved and move there by themselves when you do. Points are never cash: they come off a rental charge only, from 500 points, like every other Rewards point. A test account plays but earns nothing.',
